WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.489 --> 00:00:06.059
There's plenty of Game of Thrones trivia to
be found online — a show this epic is sure

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:09.780
to have its behind-the-scenes surprises and
Easter Eggs galore.

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:14.200
But die-hard fans are probably sick of hearing
the same old bits.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:15.680
So rejoice, supernerds!

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:21.180
Here are a few nuggets out of Westeros even
the show's biggest fans may not have heard

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:21.700
yet …

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:22.700
“Oh my god.”

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:23.460
“Oh my god!”

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:25.180
“Wow.”

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:30.140
“You have your very own Game of Thrones
iron throne toilet!”

00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:33.610
Okay — maybe that guy knows all this.

00:00:33.610 --> 00:00:34.360
But do you?

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:35.800
Watch the throne

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:41.740
In the books, the Iron Throne itself is epic
— it's made of a thousand swords and has

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:44.450
actual stairs you have to climb to reach the
seat.

00:00:44.450 --> 00:00:49.560
The show's producers decided to go with something
more realistic, but the show's prop-throne

00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:53.230
does hide some pretty epic Easter Eggs for
the super fans ....

00:00:53.230 --> 00:00:56.270
“When you play the game of thrones, you
win, or you die.”

00:00:56.270 --> 00:01:02.420
As some obsessed Redditors first pointed out
and IGN reported, if you look closely at the

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:06.350
throne, you should spot a copy of Gandalf's
sword from the Lord of the Rings, as well

00:01:06.350 --> 00:01:09.760
as swords from Robin Hood: Prince of Thieves
and Kingdom of Heaven.

00:01:10.360 --> 00:01:11.620
Heart of gross

00:01:11.980 --> 00:01:17.119
In one of the most memorable scenes from Season
1, Daenerys chowed down on a stallion heart

00:01:17.120 --> 00:01:20.100
to win the approval of the Dothraki bigwigs.

00:01:20.540 --> 00:01:25.780
Actress Emilia Clarke wasn't faking her disgust
— the "horse heart" she was eating was actually

00:01:25.800 --> 00:01:32.220
made of a gummy bear-like substance that had
been injected with a red sugary syrup so "blood"

00:01:32.409 --> 00:01:36.820
would realistically burst out of the heart
and flow down her face as she ate.

00:01:36.830 --> 00:01:42.539
But just because something is sweet doesn't
mean it's palatable: Clarke says she spent

00:01:42.540 --> 00:01:45.640
much of the day "heaving into a bucket."

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:47.460
King confusion

00:01:47.940 --> 00:01:52.179
On the show, the "Night King" is the imposing
leader of the White Walkers.

00:01:52.179 --> 00:01:57.780
In the books, there is a character named the
"Night's King," but he's a legendarily cruel

00:01:57.780 --> 00:02:00.350
human figure — not a White Walker.

00:02:00.350 --> 00:02:06.180
“Thirteen years, he and his queen ruled
over his brothers, making sacrifices as black

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:07.619
as their cloaks.”

00:02:07.619 --> 00:02:12.280
In the books, these freezer-burned freaks,
in fact, do not appear to have any noticeable

00:02:12.280 --> 00:02:18.440
social structure or hierarchy at all, let
alone a king, making his icy highness a TV

00:02:18.440 --> 00:02:19.000
exclusive.

00:02:19.660 --> 00:02:20.820
Slice and dice

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:26.520
Game of Thrones is a television sensation
around the world, but we're not all necessarily

00:02:26.530 --> 00:02:28.190
watching the same thing.

00:02:28.190 --> 00:02:34.490
When China's state TV station began re-airing
the series in 2014, fans quickly noticed that

00:02:34.490 --> 00:02:39.470
they had heavily censored the episodes — cutting
nearly all of the violence and nudity.

00:02:39.470 --> 00:02:45.200
That's a bit like cutting all of the "Roadrunner
chasing" out of a Wile E. Coyote cartoon.

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:50.660
But it could be worse: In Turkey, the government
outright banned the show in 2014 from being

00:02:50.660 --> 00:02:55.400
played at the country's military training
schools, citing a desire to protect recruits

00:02:55.400 --> 00:03:02.140
from viewing images of "sexual exploitation,
pornography, exhibitionism, abuse, harassment

00:03:02.140 --> 00:03:03.860
and all negative behaviors."

00:03:04.540 --> 00:03:05.620
Wandering minstrels

00:03:06.100 --> 00:03:10.610
Quite a few musicians have had cameos on the
show through the years, including Snow Patrol

00:03:10.610 --> 00:03:13.900
singer Gary Lightbody, making a vocal contribution
…

00:03:13.900 --> 00:03:18.750
"She kicked and wailed / A maid so fair / But
he licked the honey from her hair.”

00:03:18.750 --> 00:03:24.040
… Coldplay drummer Will Champion doing his
thing at the infamous Red Wedding, and Icelandic

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:28.280
post-rock group Sigur Ros playing minstrels
at Joffrey's wedding …

00:03:31.760 --> 00:03:32.780
"Very good, very good.

00:03:32.780 --> 00:03:33.780
Off you go."

00:03:36.470 --> 00:03:40.600
Three members of the metal group Mastodon
also made an appearance during the battle

00:03:40.600 --> 00:03:46.080
at Hardhome, and frontman Brent Hinds is set
to make a reappearance in season seven in

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:47.100
the same role.

00:03:47.100 --> 00:03:52.940
Singer/songwriter Ed Sheeran will also make
a season seven cameo, orchestrated as a surprise

00:03:52.940 --> 00:03:56.580
for his fan, Maisie Williams, also known as
Arya Stark.

00:03:57.440 --> 00:03:58.440
Stunt butt

00:03:58.660 --> 00:04:04.820
Many Jon Snow fans may have swooned when they
got a glimpse of his bare bottom during that

00:04:04.820 --> 00:04:06.940
Season 3 cave scene with Ygritte.

00:04:06.940 --> 00:04:09.120
Unfortunately, that wasn't the real deal.

00:04:09.120 --> 00:04:14.140
Shortly before filming for the season began,
actor Kit Harington says he fell from his

00:04:14.140 --> 00:04:19.299
second-story window ledge in a drunken attempt
to retrieve his keys from his locked flat,

00:04:19.299 --> 00:04:24.970
breaking an ankle, which left him unable to
film full-body shots for the first few weeks.

00:04:24.970 --> 00:04:29.419
Luckily, a similarly-built crew member stepped
in to lend a butt.

00:04:29.420 --> 00:04:31.900
So now you know: We were butt-boozled.

00:04:32.440 --> 00:04:33.100
"Stop that.

00:04:33.520 --> 00:04:35.140
You're making me uncomfortable."

00:04:35.150 --> 00:04:36.150
Thanks for watching!

00:04:36.150 --> 00:04:38.969
Click the Looper icon to subscribe to our
YouTube channel.

00:04:38.969 --> 00:04:41.389
Plus check out all this cool stuff we know
you'll love, too!

